    InLine(ty: Struct((size: UnsizedFinalStructure, crate_idx: 0, docs: [
        "A counted base of a [Dim] and its exponent: what is counted (`\"Sample\"`, `\"Block\"`, an API\'s own marker name) and",
        "how often it is in the dimension (`Sample/s` has `Sample` to the 1st power).",
        "",
        "A base is told apart by its name only, so two APIs\' own `Block` markers are the same base at run time (in types",
        "they stay different markers).",
    ], ident: "Counted", generics: [], fields: Named([
        (ident: Some("name"), default: None, since: None, ty: String, docs: [], slot: None, series_opaque: false),
        (ident: Some("exp"), default: None, since: None, ty: NumericAny(Base(IB(4))), docs: [], slot: None, series_opaque: false),
    ]), sparse: false, path: None, instance_of: None, transparent: false)), crate_idx: 0),
    InLine(ty: Struct((size: UnsizedFinalStructure, crate_idx: 0, docs: [
        "The dimension of a unit: exponents of the 7 SI base units s, m, kg, A, K, mol, cd, of angle (rad) and of",
        "information (bit), each from -8 to 7, and of up to [MAX_COUNTED] counted bases (`Sample`, `Block`, `Item`, ..).",
        "Volt is kg·m²·s⁻³·A⁻¹: `Dim::new(-3, 2, 1, -1, 0, 0, 0)`; rad/s is `Dim::new(-1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0).with_rad(1)`;",
        "samples per second is `Dim::counted(\"Sample\").div(Dim::new(1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0))`.",
        "",
        "Values convert into each other and add only with the same dimension: bytes never become a ratio, an angle never",
        "a frequency, samples never bytes (that takes a `Per<Byte, Sample>`).",
        "",
        "On the wire nine 4-bit signed numbers in the order above, then for each of the [MAX_COUNTED] slots a bit for",
        "whether it is used, and a used one\'s name and exponent. Used slots come first, sorted by name, with exponents that",
        "aren\'t 0 (a value that isn\'t so doesn\'t decode), so two equal dimensions have the same bytes: Volt is",
        "`d2 1f 00 00 00` (40 bits).",
    ], ident: "Dim", generics: [], fields: Named([
        (ident: Some("s"), default: None, since: None, ty: NumericAny(Base(IB(4))), docs: [], slot: None, series_opaque: false),
        (ident: Some("m"), default: None, since: None, ty: NumericAny(Base(IB(4))), docs: [], slot: None, series_opaque: false),
        (ident: Some("kg"), default: None, since: None, ty: NumericAny(Base(IB(4))), docs: [], slot: None, series_opaque: false),
        (ident: Some("a"), default: None, since: None, ty: NumericAny(Base(IB(4))), docs: [], slot: None, series_opaque: false),
        (ident: Some("k"), default: None, since: None, ty: NumericAny(Base(IB(4))), docs: [], slot: None, series_opaque: false),
        (ident: Some("mol"), default: None, since: None, ty: NumericAny(Base(IB(4))), docs: [], slot: None, series_opaque: false),
        (ident: Some("cd"), default: None, since: None, ty: NumericAny(Base(IB(4))), docs: [], slot: None, series_opaque: false),
        (ident: Some("rad"), default: None, since: None, ty: NumericAny(Base(IB(4))), docs: [
            "Plane angle, radian.",
        ], slot: None, series_opaque: false),
        (ident: Some("bit"), default: None, since: None, ty: NumericAny(Base(IB(4))), docs: [
            "Information, bit.",
        ], slot: None, series_opaque: false),
        (ident: Some("counted"), default: None, since: None, ty: Array(len: Fixed(4), ty: Option(some_ty: OutOfLine(type_idx: 2))), docs: [
            "Counted bases, see [Counted]: used slots first, sorted by name.",
        ], slot: None, series_opaque: false),
    ]), sparse: false, path: None, instance_of: None, transparent: false)), crate_idx: 0),
